      {
        "id": "ray-sphere",
        "moduleId": "intersection-math",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "光线-球面求交",
        "markdown": "半径 $r$、球心 $\\mathbf{P}_c$ 的球面满足\n\n$$\\lvert\\mathbf{P}-\\mathbf{P}_c\\rvert^2-r^2=0$$\n\n把光线方程代入并令 $\\Delta\\mathbf{P}=\\mathbf{P}_c-\\mathbf{P}_0$，展开点积得到关于 $s$ 的二次方程：\n\n$$s^2-2(\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P})s+(\\lvert\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\rvert^2-r^2)=0$$\n\n解得\n\n$$s=\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\pm\\sqrt{(\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P})^2-\\lvert\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\rvert^2+r^2}$$\n\n若两根均为负，说明球面位于起点背后或光线背离球面，可不再考虑该球面；否则取非负根中较小者，再代回光线方程得到交点。当球体很小且离光线起点很远时，$r^2\\ll\\lvert\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\rvert^2$，直接计算易丢失 $r^2$ 项，可用\n\n$$s=\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\pm\\sqrt{r^2-\\lvert\\Delta\\mathbf{P}-(\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P})\\mathbf{u}\\rvert^2}$$\n\n减轻舍入误差。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
