      {
        "id": "model-sphere-worked-example",
        "moduleId": "intersection-math",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "算例：求球面交点",
        "markdown": "设光线起点 $\\mathbf{P}_0=(0,0,0)$、方向 $\\mathbf{u}=(0,0,-1)$，球心 $\\mathbf{P}_c=(0,0,-5)$、半径 $r=1$。则 $\\Delta\\mathbf{P}=(0,0,-5)$，$\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\Delta\\mathbf{P}=5$，$\\lvert\\Delta\\mathbf{P}\\rvert^2=25$，判别式为 $25-25+1=1$。于是 $s=5\\pm 1$，两根为 4 和 6，都为正；取较小者 $s=4$，代回光线方程得交点 $(0,0,-4)$，它正是光线上先遇到球面的位置。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "ray-sphere"
          ]
        }
